keywords:
  - molecular dimers
  - metal-organic cages
  - porous organic cages
  - molecular simulation
  - crystal packing
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for generating molecular dimers along user-defined
  molecular axes, rejecting overlapping or catenated configurations, and
  preparing the resulting structures for optimisation with xTB, GULP, or
  MacroModel.
